        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Simei rangbang khou ai #!7 tat bam khou,",
            "Heikhou tei neila gaipui chang phu ban khou;",
            "Theimei duipang khou kalang khuan chuna,",
            "Pingmei #!7 alung khou nai e.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He Jisu ata jai guang lou o,",
            "Poubaumei ai chang man na;",
            "Mang tat bam khou.",
            "",
            "2. Pap tanmei suan mu theimei hei na de,",
            "Ai#!7 theimei duipang khou pat ngammak;",
            "Kum sini chang baimei mak poubaumei,",
            "Kanloumeipu nang ta ning e.",
            "",
            "3. Tingkum heisan nangta gan lou sini,",
            "Kagan kathui nang jian na jailou o;",
            "Kabam kathui nang nade he Raguang,",
            "Kandih khou thuanmei padik diu."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
